      "trackName": "Sudoku Wear: 4x4 Watch Puzzle",
      "description": "Sudoku Wear brings the classic mental challenge directly to your wrist with a beautiful, minimalist design optimized for Apple Watch.\nPerfect for quick sessions on the go! Play the traditional way or challenge your mind with unique visual modes.\n\nGame Modes:\n- Numbers: The classic 4x4 grid experience.\n- Colors: A visual twist that challenges your perception.\n- Images: Modern and fun icon-based puzzles.\n\nKey Features:\n- Designed for your Watch: Super simple gameplay. Just tap a cell to increase its value automatically.\n- Battery Friendly: Developed with deep dark colors to protect and extend your Apple Watch battery life.\n- Cross-Device Support: Enjoy the 4x4 mode on your wrist, or unlock full 4x4 and 9x9 grids on your iPhone and iPad!",
      "releaseNotes": "- Updated dependences",
